      "traditional": "又有一隻貓說：“太熱了！我想喝水！”",
      "pinyin": "yòu yǒu yì zhī māo shuō tài rè le wǒ xiǎng hē shuǐ",
      "english": "Another cat said, “It’s too hot! I want to drink water!”"
    },
    {
