      "english": "The old man saw that there was a lake there."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "老爷爷说：“那里有很多水！你们喝，你们喝！”",
      "traditional": "老爺爺說：“那裡有很多水！你們喝，你們喝！”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo yé ye shuō nà lǐ yǒu hěn duō shuǐ nǐ men hē nǐ men hē",
      "english": "The old man said, “There is a lot of water there! You go drink, you go drink!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
